@When "^approves the pending trade from trade portal$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal approve action button is visible
    And page trade portal clicks approve action for current trade
    And page trade portal confirms approval or reject trade

@When "^rejects the pending trade from trade portal$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal reject action button is visible
    And page trade portal clicks reject action for current trade
    And page trade portal confirms approval or reject trade

@When "^selects all pending cancellation trades and submits a bulk approval$"
    When page trade portal filters trade by product type as 'FX_TRF'
    And page trade portal filters trade by trade status as 'Pending Approval'
    And page trade portal filters trade by event status as 'Cancelled'
    And page trade portal selects trade stored as 'createdTradeId1' for bulk action
    And page trade portal selects trade stored as 'createdTradeId2' for bulk action
    And page trade portal clicks bulk approve for selected trades
    And page trade portal confirms approval or reject trade

@Then "^cannot approve or reject the Pending Approval trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade portal approve action is not available for current trade
    And page trade portal reject action is not available for current trade
    And page trade portal view details action is available for current trade
    And page trade portal cancel action is available for current trade
    And page trade portal lifecycle event actions are not available for current trade

@Then "^can perform lifecycle actions on the Live trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade portal view details action is available for current trade
    And page trade portal lifecycle event actions are available for current trade
